		(rev "V1")
		(company "Senior Design")
		(comment 1 "Carter Cattadoris")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "LAYOUT_NOTES (record only; layout by Carter)\n- Floorplan: RF zone at one end (Synthesizer, Receiver, both RF connectors, J301 beside the RX connector).\n  Baseband and ADC in the middle, I and Q side by side as mirror images. Power and digital at the far end,\n  both bucks and the charger farthest from RF and baseband. ESP32 at the edge opposite the RF zone,\n  antenna keepout clear of copper on all layers.\n- Baseband: lay out Q as an exact copy of I (multichannel / repeat layout). Star-route VREF_BUF within each channel.\n- Power path: +VBUS, +VSYS, +VBAT as pours or >= 1.0 mm traces. Keep the BQ25883 SW loop and both buck SW loops\n  minimal. No analog nets under or adjacent to any SW node or inductor.\n- USB: BQ25883 D+/D- stubs (R202/R203) < 5 mm. Keep pour >= 0.5 mm from the pair.\n- Placement: RT201 right next to J201 (pack location). 33R display / I2S series resistors at the ESP32 end.\n- Exposed pads (BQ25883, TPS7A8300 x4): thermal vias, windowpane paste. RGR EP: TI land 2.05 mm, KiCad fp 2.0 mm.\n- Thermal: LDO305 (+3V3_SYN) dissipates ~0.46 W. GND pad-via array to L2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
